  "content": "<h2>XaeroZoomout</h2><p>將<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fNcUtCpym\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero的世界地圖</a>的最小縮放從0.0625倍降低到0.0025倍。</p><h3>功能</h3><p>無需設定，無需配置；只需縮小，即可觀看效果。</p><p>作為參考，Xaero的世界地圖在完全縮小時通常約有30K方塊寬。使用此模組後，顯示寬度增加到約760K。</p><p>注意：渲染世界地圖相當耗費CPU，因此在完全縮小時您可能會感受到一些延遲。</p><h3>授權條款</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache-2.0</a></p><h3>聯繫方式</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fterminalmc.dev%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&amp;label=Discord Server&amp;color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord伺服器\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/XaeroZoomout/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/XaeroZoomout?logo=github&amp;label=GitHub Issues\" alt=\"GitHub問題回報\"></a></p>",
